{"id":"d984717bb6601580","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-limit.md","title":"相对极限引理","display":"thm-relative-limit — 相对极限引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-limit","aliases":["20-thm-relative-limit"],"display":"thm-relative-limit — 相对极限引理","chapter":"3","section":"3.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Lemma 3.6.2 的相对化","source_pdf_pages":[103],"source_printed_pages":[67],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-limit — 相对极限引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 3.6.2 的相对化"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>103</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为全函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{A&#39;}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g\\in(\\mathcal C_2^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [g\\rightsquigarrow f].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{A&#39;}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g\\in(\\mathcal C_2^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [g\\rightsquigarrow f].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上游两向证明中的普通枚举、有界模拟和改变询问均相对化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。近似函数允许依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，不能误写成普通可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 3.6.2 的相对化；印刷页 67；PDF 第 103 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{A'}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g\\in(\\mathcal C_2^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [g\\rightsquigarrow f].","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"6330178076c4520f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt